Note that this is just one example of how to use GitHub Actions to automate the build process for a Python project. You could also use other languages like JavaScript, Ruby, or even Node.js depending on your needs. Additionally, you may want to consider adding additional steps such as linting, testing, and security checks to ensure the quality of the build.

