Introduction:
Community tax certificates and other relevant permits and clearances play a crucial role in ensuring the financial stability of communities. However, traditional methods of issuing these documents have been slow and inefficient, leading to delays and costly mistakes. This paper presents a new approach to issuing community tax certificates and other relevant permits and clearances using digital certificates, which is both innovative and novel.

